<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<%- include('./../common/header') %>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/axios/dist/axios.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://js.tosspayments.com/v2/standard"></script>
<!--
  카카오톡 채널 추가 팝업은 채널 추가 페이지(pf.kakao.com/{채널ID}/friend)를 새 창으로 여는 방식이라
  Kakao JS SDK를 싣지 않는다. 비즈 앱 전환 후 followChannel() 방식으로 되돌릴 경우
  https://t1.kakaocdn.net/kakao_js_sdk/2.7.2/kakao.min.js 를 다시 추가하고
  Kakao Developers 콘솔 > 앱 설정 > 플랫폼 > Web 에 개발/프로덕션 도메인을 등록해야 한다.
-->

<body class="bg-gray-100">

    <div class="w-full max-w-[480px] mx-auto">
        <div class="flex justify-center flex-col items-center mx-auto max-w-7xl">
            <div class="max-w-md w-full sm:border-x text-left bg-white min-h-screen">

                <div class="flex items-center justify-center border-b relative py-3">
                    <a href="/s/bluemoonladysaju/result" class="absolute left-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-800" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" fill="currentColor">
                            <path d="M724 218.3V141c0-6.7-7.7-10.4-12.9-6.3L260.3 486.8c-16.4 12.8-16.4 37.5 0 50.3l450.8 352.1c5.3 4.1 12.9.4 12.9-6.3v-77.3c0-4.9-2.3-9.6-6.1-12.6l-360-281 360-281.1c3.8-3 6.1-7.7 6.1-12.6z"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">결제하기</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 space-y-6">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-lg font-bold">휴대폰 번호</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">사주 결과 확인 및 안내 메시지 발송에 이용됩니다.</p>
                        <div class="flex gap-2 mt-2">
                            <select class="w-1/4 border border-gray-300 rounded px-2 py-1 text-sm bg-gray-50" disabled><option>010</option></select>
                            <input type="tel" name="buyerTelF" maxlength="4" class="w-1/4 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-gray-50 focus:bg-white" />
                            <input type="tel" name="buyerTelB" maxlength="4" class="w-1/4 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-gray-50 focus:bg-white" />
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <p class="text-lg font-bold mt-6">비밀번호 <span class="text-xs">(숫자 4자리)</span></p>
                        <input type="password" name="buyerPW" maxlength="4" class="w-full border border-gray-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 mt-2 text-sm bg-gray-50 focus:bg-white" />
                    </div>

                    <hr class="border-gray-100 my-6">

                    <div>
                        <p class="text-lg font-bold mb-4">상품 선택</p>
                        <div class="space-y-3">
                            <div onclick="selectOption('single')" id="card-single" class="goods-card is-selected">
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                    <div class="radio-dot"></div>
                                    <div>
                                        <p class="text-[11px] font-bold ">기본 패키지</p>
                                        <p class="font-bold text-gray-800"><%= goodsInfo.title %></p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <p class="font-bold text-gray-900"><%= goodsInfo.price.toLocaleString() %>원</p>
                            </div>

                            <% if (typeof bundles !== 'undefined' && bundles && bundles.length) { %>
                            <% bundles.forEach(function(b, bi){ %>
          <div onclick="selectOption('<%= b.code %>')" id="card-<%= b.code %>" class="goods-card bundle-card relative border-2 <%= b.theme === 'blue' ? 'bundle-card--blue' : 'bundle-card--red' %>">
            <% if (bi === 0) { %><div class="best-badge">BEST</div><% } %>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="radio-dot border-pink-400"></div>
        <div>
 <% if (Array.isArray(b.giveTickets) && b.giveTickets.length >= 2) { %>
 <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-pink-600">
👑 프리미엄 추천 구성      </p>
 <% } %>
      <p class="font-bold text-gray-800">
        <%= goodsInfo.title %> + <%= b.partnerTitle %>
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-pink-500 mt-0.5"><%= b.benefit %> 증정</p>
        </div>
    </div>
                                    <p class="font-bold text-gray-900"><%= b.price.toLocaleString() %>원</p>

    </div>
                            <% }); %>

   <div id="bundle-notice" class="hidden animate-fade-in mt-4">
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-pink-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-50 to-white p-5 shadow-sm">
    
    <p class="font-bold text-pink-600 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
       ※ 번들 전용 혜택 사용 안내
    </p>

    <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <li class="flex gap-2">
        <span>📩</span>
        <span><b>티켓은 결제 즉시 문자(SMS)로 발송</b>됩니다.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-2">
        <span>🎟</span>
        <span><b>오른쪽 메뉴 → ‘티켓’</b> 메뉴에서 바로 사용 가능합니다.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-2">
        <span>🎁</span>
        <span><b>지인에게 선물</b>도 가능하며, <b>본인이 사용</b>해도 됩니다.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="text-[11px] text-pink-400 mt-3">
      ※ 티켓은 1회 사용 가능 / 유효기간 없음
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-gray-200 space-y-4 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 px-4 pb-4">
                <p id="bundle-highlight" style="display:none; font-size:12px; color:#ec4899; font-weight:600;">
  🔥 지금 가장 많이 선택되는 구성입니다
</p>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-sm text-gray-600">
                            <p id="detail-title"><%= goodsInfo.title %></p>
                            <p id="detail-original-price"><%= goodsInfo.originalPrice.toLocaleString() %>원</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div id="discount-row" class="flex justify-between text-blue-600 text-sm">
                            <p>특별 할인</p>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span id="detail-discount-rate" class="text-[10px] bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full px-2 h-4 flex items-center">
                                    -<%= Math.floor((goodsInfo.discountPrice / goodsInfo.originalPrice) * 100) %>%
                                </span>
                                <span id="detail-discount-price">-<%= goodsInfo.discountPrice.toLocaleString() %>원</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div id="channel-coupon-row" class="hidden flex justify-between text-sm" style="color:#f59e0b;">
                            <p class="flex items-center gap-1">
                                카카오톡 채널 쿠폰
                                <span id="channel-coupon-code" class="text-[10px] bg-yellow-400 text-yellow-900 rounded-full px-2 h-4 flex items-center font-bold"><%= channelCouponCode %></span>
                            </p>
                            <span id="channel-coupon-amount">-<%= channelCouponDiscount.toLocaleString() %>원</span>
                        </div>

                        <p id="channel-coupon-hint" class="hidden text-[11px] text-gray-400">
                            ※ 채널 쿠폰은 번들 상품 결제 시에만 적용됩니다
                        </p>

                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 mt-3 font-bold">
                            <p>최종 결제금액</p>
                            <p id="final-price-display" class="text-xl text-blue-600">
                                <%= goodsInfo.price.toLocaleString() %>원
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-8 space-y-3">
                        <button onclick="requestTossCardPayment()" class="w-full text-white text-lg font-bold py-3 rounded shadow flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color: #0064ff;">
                            <span style="color: white;">결제하기</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <%- include('./../common/footer') %>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 쿠폰 적용 안내 토스트 -->
    <div id="channel-toast" class="channel-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="channel-toast__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" />
            </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="channel-toast__body">
            <p class="channel-toast__title"><%= channelCouponDiscount.toLocaleString() %>원 할인쿠폰이 적용됐어요</p>
            <p class="channel-toast__desc">
                <span class="channel-toast__code"><%= channelCouponCode %></span>
                최종 결제금액에서 자동 차감됩니다
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 결제 이탈 방지 모달 -->
    <div id="exit-modal" class="exit-modal hidden" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="exit-modal__backdrop"></div>
        <div class="exit-modal__sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="exit-modal-title">
            <div class="exit-modal__handle" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="exit-modal__badge">지금만 적용되는 할인</div>
            <h3 id="exit-modal-title" class="exit-modal__title">잠깐만요!<br>할인 혜택이 사라져요</h3>
            <p class="exit-modal__subtitle">아래 시간이 지나면 특별 할인이 종료됩니다</p>

            <div class="exit-modal__timer-wrap">
                <div class="exit-timer-unit">
                    <span id="exit-hours" class="exit-timer-num">00</span>
                    <span class="exit-timer-label">시간</span>
                </div>
                <span class="exit-timer-colon">:</span>
                <div class="exit-timer-unit">
                    <span id="exit-minutes" class="exit-timer-num">00</span>
                    <span class="exit-timer-label">분</span>
                </div>
                <span class="exit-timer-colon">:</span>
                <div class="exit-timer-unit">
                    <span id="exit-seconds" class="exit-timer-num">00</span>
                    <span class="exit-timer-label">초</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="exit-modal__benefit-card">
                <p class="exit-modal__benefit-label">지금 나가면 놓치는 혜택</p>
                <p id="exit-benefit" class="exit-modal__benefit-amount">21,900원</p>
            </div>

            <div class="exit-modal__actions">
                <button type="button" id="exit-stay-btn" class="exit-modal__btn exit-modal__btn--primary">할인 받고 계속하기</button>
                <button type="button" id="exit-leave-btn" class="exit-modal__btn exit-modal__btn--ghost">그냥 나갈래요</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 카카오톡 채널 추가 유도 팝업 (상품 키아트를 배경으로 쓰는 전면형) -->
    <div id="channel-modal" class="channel-modal hidden" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="channel-modal__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="channel-modal-title"
             <% if (channelPopupImage) { %>style="background-image: url('<%= channelPopupImage %>');"<% } %>>
            <button type="button" id="channel-close-btn" class="channel-modal__close" aria-label="닫기">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
                    <path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18" />
                </svg>
            </button>

            <div class="channel-modal__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="channel-modal__content">
                <p class="channel-modal__badge">카카오톡 채널 추가 혜택</p>
                <h3 id="channel-modal-title" class="channel-modal__title">
                    지금 채널 추가만 해도<br>
                    <em><%= channelCouponDiscount.toLocaleString() %>원 할인!</em>
                </h3>
                <p class="channel-modal__desc">
                    채널 추가 안 하면 혜택을 놓쳐요<br>
                    지금 추가하고 번들 상품 결제할 때 바로 쓰세요
                </p>

                <button type="button" id="channel-follow-btn" class="channel-modal__cta">
                    <svg class="channel-modal__cta-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M12 3C6.9 3 2.8 6.3 2.8 10.3c0 2.6 1.7 4.9 4.3 6.2-.2.7-.7 2.5-.8 2.9-.1.5.2.5.4.4.2-.1 2.6-1.8 3.7-2.5.5.1 1.1.1 1.6.1 5.1 0 9.2-3.3 9.2-7.1S17.1 3 12 3z" />
                    </svg>
                    3초만에 채널 추가하고 쿠폰 받기
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="channel-later-btn" class="channel-modal__later">24시간 동안 안 보기</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <style>
        .goods-card { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1.5px solid #f3f4f6; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .goods-card.is-selected { border-color: #0064ff; background-color: #f0f7ff; }
        .radio-dot { width: 18px; height: 18px; border: 2px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 50%; position: relative; }
        .is-selected .radio-dot { border-color: #0064ff; }
        .is-selected .radio-dot::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #0064ff; border-radius: 50%; }

        /* 번들 전용 흔들림 애니메이션 (주의 집중) */
@keyframes soft-bounce {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-2px); }
}
.best-badge-anim {
    animation: soft-bounce 2s infinite ease-in-out;
}
#card-bundle.is-selected {
  border: 2px solid #ec4899 !important;
  background: #fff1f2 !important;
}
/* 번들 선택 시 보더 색상 차별화 */
#card-bundle.is-selected {
    border-color: #ec4899 !important; /* 핑크색 강조 */
    background-color: #fff1f2 !important;
}
.best-badge {
  position: absolute;
  top: -10px;
  right: -10px;
  background: #ec4899;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  z-index: 20;
  animation: soft-bounce 2s infinite ease-in-out;
}
#card-bundle {
  padding: 22px 20px !important;   /* 위아래만 더 */
  margin: 6px 0;                   /* 공간 확보 */
  border-width: 2px !important;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(236,72,153,0.18);
}

.goods-card {
  width: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
#card-bundle {
  transform: none !important;
}
/* 다중 번들 카드 (동적 id: card-<BUNDLE_CODE>) */
.bundle-card {
  padding: 22px 20px !important;
  margin: 6px 0;
  border-width: 2px !important;
  background: #fff;                 /* 기본: 흰색 */
  border-color: #e5e7eb;            /* gray-200 */
  box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
}

/* ── 빨강 테마(일반 번들): 흰색 → 선택 시 빨강 ── */
.bundle-card--red .text-pink-600 { color: #dc2626 !important; }
.bundle-card--red .text-pink-500 { color: #ef4444 !important; }
.bundle-card--red .radio-dot { border-color: #ef4444 !important; }
.bundle-card--red .best-badge { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f87171, #ef4444); }
.bundle-card--red.is-selected {
  border-color: #ef4444 !important;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5f5 0%, #fee2e2 100%) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(239,68,68,0.20) !important;
}

/* ── 파랑 테마(3종 번들): 흰색 → 선택 시 파랑 그라데이션 ── */
.bundle-card--blue .text-pink-600 { color: #2563eb !important; }
.bundle-card--blue .text-pink-500 { color: #3b82f6 !important; }
.bundle-card--blue .radio-dot { border-color: #60a5fa !important; }
.bundle-card--blue .best-badge { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb); }
.bundle-card--blue.is-selected {
  border-color: #2563eb !important;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eff6ff 0%, #bfdbfe 100%) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(37,99,235,0.20) !important;
}
.bundle-card .radio-dot {
  transform: scale(1.2);
}
#card-single {
  padding: 14px 16px;
  opacity: 0.85;
}
#card-bundle .radio-dot {
  transform: scale(1.2);
}

/* 결제 이탈 방지 모달 — 바텀시트 */
.exit-modal {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 9999;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: center;
}
.exit-modal.hidden {
  display: none;
}
.exit-modal__backdrop {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.45);
  backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
}
.exit-modal__sheet {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 480px;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;
  padding: 12px 24px calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 -8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  animation: exit-sheet-up 0.32s ease-out;
}
@keyframes exit-sheet-up {
  from { transform: translateY(100%); opacity: 0.6; }
  to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
}
.exit-modal__handle {
  width: 40px;
  height: 4px;
  margin: 0 auto 16px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #e5e7eb;
}
.exit-modal__badge {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #fff1f2;
  color: #ec4899;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.exit-modal__title {
  color: #111827;
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.35;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.exit-modal__subtitle {
  color: #6b7280;
  font-size: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.exit-modal__timer-wrap {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.exit-timer-unit {
  min-width: 72px;
  padding: 12px 8px 10px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: #f0f7ff;
  border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
}
.exit-timer-num {
  display: block;
  color: #0064ff;
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.exit-timer-label {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 6px;
  color: #6b7280;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.exit-timer-colon {
  color: #9ca3af;
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-top: -18px;
}
.exit-modal__benefit-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc 0%, #f0f7ff 100%);
  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.exit-modal__benefit-label {
  color: #6b7280;
  font-size: 13px;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.exit-modal__benefit-amount {
  color: #0064ff;
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.exit-modal__actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}
.exit-modal__btn {
  width: 100%;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 15px 12px;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.exit-modal__btn--primary {
  background: #0064ff;
  color: #fff;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 100, 255, 0.25);
}
.exit-modal__btn--ghost {
  background: transparent;
  color: #9ca3af;
  padding: 10px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
}

/* ── 카카오톡 채널 추가 팝업 (전면형) ──
   상품 키아트를 배경으로 깔고 하단을 어둡게 덮어 문구·CTA를 얹는다. */
.channel-modal {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 9999;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72);
  animation: channel-fade-in 0.25s ease-out;
}
.channel-modal.hidden {
  display: none;
}
@keyframes channel-fade-in {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
